===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Emerging Powers|Ferroseed|70}} from the {{TCG|Emerging Powers}} expansion.
*'''Spike Sting''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Qwilfish|60}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
